        "created_at": "2013-10-29T21:35:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's supposed to deal the hero with the most cards in play 2 projectile damage at the end of the villain turn. What if nobody has cards in play? This was the first card played from the villain deck at start of a game.</p><p>I assume it's another ambiguous situaion in which the player(s) choose the outcome/target, but again I want to make sure.</p><p>Thanks</p>",
