        "created_at": "2013-10-29T21:43:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Everybody is tied for the most number of cards (0) so it's heroes' choice.</p><p>But just give it to Haka, he loves that kind of stuff from Ambuscade, haven't you seen them frolicking at the the theme park?</p>",
