        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Matchstickman\"]\nBut just give it to Haka, he loves that kind of stuff from Ambuscade, haven&#39;t you seen them frolicking at the the theme park?\n[/quote]\n\nThis is probably sarcasm, just to make sure the OP knows.&nbsp; Granted, Haka has an immense amount of HP, but he takes +1 damage from Ambuscade due to the nemesis rule, and also deals +1 damage to Ambuscade for the same reason.&nbsp; So depending on who else is out, you <em>might</em> want Haka to absorb the hits, but it equally well might not be a good idea.\n",
